    "text": "For which of the following molecules <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/3f543dfa-f130-4e07-be04-81b5cedf733a.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:4.025in;height:1.69167in\" />",
